From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP evacuate players out of the empty-buffer cut

Packed spawn keeps PLAYER tickets on the corridor section because carve
skipped ServerPlayer and the bench home-leash yanked bots back into
section X=-1. Relocate players onto same-thread pads so force-partition
can finish under product view-distance. Carve stays on.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

